# Build intermediates. Regenerated by every build and nothing reads them.
bin/
obj/

# Installers and the like must never reach git - GitHub rejects anything over
# 100 MB. Three of them (Unity, Unity Hub, OBS) once landed in tools/out and
# took that folder to 3.6 GB.
*.exe
*.msi

# Everything else is deliberately tracked: the generated models, the extracted
# game assets, the baked textures, the render previews, the built bundles and
# the release archives. They are the visible record of how the mod was made.
